fcitx5-nextless (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian/Ubuntu package. Ships the fcitx5 push-to-talk addon,
    the `nextless-get-models` helper and the packaged config defaults.
    ASR models are deliberately NOT in the payload (first-run download).

